  "schema_version": "shot_coverage.v002",
  "note": "v001's shot list was written the way a director speaks. This one is written the way the shelf's titles are written, because on 2026-08-09 every one of v001's thirteen zero-coverage shots turned out to have material behind it that the wording could not reach. `handcuffs on wrists` returned nothing while 16 of 20 items in the weak pool were literally handcuffs on wrists; `fingerprint card` collided with credit cards and circuit boards while five fingerprinting shots sat below the floor. The scoring floor is not the problem and was not loosened - the shot spec has to name the thing in the words a stock title would use. Every phrase here was measured, and the ones that were not obvious were looked at on a contact sheet.",
